  "why": "Nanocodex is no longer an agent the helper or the app knows: upstream (gakonst/nanocode, renamed from nanocodex) removed the TUI control socket and the $CODEX_HOME/nanocodex/tui/instances registration its harness attached through (2d4a4c53, 2026-10-13), so the harness, its tests and its docs are gone. A launch's position is its protocol id and its route section (harness/<index>): Codex, registered after Nanocodex, is now launch 2 in section harness/2 instead of 3, launches.list lists three agents, and the app audits three installations at start. Every recording made with a helper that registered Nanocodex therefore records a fourth harness section the helper no longer opens and Codex's work under another section (`unconsumed: harness/N executable|route|now|submit`, `replay exhausted section: harness/N`), which neither a rewrite nor a wire conversion can express: the 312 tests whose helper recordings failed replay (which include every test whose recordings name nanocodex) are recorded again. NanocodexTests' own recordings are deleted with the tests.",
